00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:11,420
Slide 9 explores INTELLECTUAL STEWARDSHIP UNDER SOLI DEO GLORIA. Sarah, James, why must we remain masters of our desktop tools?

2
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:19,878
Look at Card 1: Sovereignty Over Tools. God created humans in His image with intellect, reason, and creative purpose.

3
00:00:19,878 --> 00:00:26,650
We must command our tools with intentionality, not surrender our minds to addictive feed algorithms!

4
00:00:27,050 --> 00:00:38,620
Look at Card 2: Local Privacy Protection. Your personal journal, family photos, and proprietary client source code must NOT be treated as free training fodder for big tech monopolies!

5
00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:51,740
And Card 3: Focus Restoration. By disabling manipulative promotional popups and notification badges, we protect sacred quiet time for contemplation, prayer, and deep design.

6
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:53,340
Amen, Sarah!

7
00:00:53,340 --> 00:00:57,440
A peaceful desktop creates a peaceful mind.

8
00:00:57,840 --> 00:01:04,510
Stewardship means exercising conscious moral control over the digital environment where we work every day.

